```bash
# Set workdir to the agentide repo (the parent cwd is NOT a git repo)
gh issue list --label wayfinder:grilling --state all
gh issue view 12 --json title,body,state,labels,assignees,comments
gh issue edit 12 --add-assignee spanexx
gh issue comment 12 --body "..."
gh issue close 12
gh issue edit 8 --body-file /tmp/opencode/map-body.md

# Append to CONTEXT.md (one line per Q, in the Decisions Log section)
